# Tweedles and the Adventure Kids Club

Promotional site for parents and kids (about ages 3–8). Big, bright, bold, playful space-adventure look: huge images, rounded corners, chunky buttons, lots of color.

## Type and color

- Headings use Fredoka (`font-heading`). Body uses Nunito (`font-sans`). Both come from `next/font/google` in `src/app/layout.tsx`.
- Brand colors are the unsuffixed Tailwind utilities. Do not substitute the numbered palette (`bg-sky-400`) for these:
  - `navy` `#1B1464` — dark background
  - `gold` `#FFC93C` — Max
  - `lime` `#A3E635` — Blaze
  - `purple` `#A855F7` — Pip
  - `pink` `#FF3EA5` — Luna
  - `sky` `#38BDF8` — Tweedles
  - `orange` `#FF8A00` — Ember
- White text on dark areas.
- Mobile first. The phone layout must look great.
- Body text is at least 18px on mobile.
- Tap targets are at least 48px (`min-h-12`). Kids use phones and tablets.

```tsx
<a className="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-full bg-gold px-6 text-lg font-heading text-navy">
  Blast off
</a>
```

## Accessibility

- Alt text on every image.
- Keep contrast strong: white or navy on the brand colors.
- Keyboard navigation: visible focus, logical order, real buttons and links.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. The starfield twinkle is paused there. New motion must pause or stop the same way.

## Kid-safe

- No ads, no trackers, no third-party cookies.
- YouTube embeds use `youtube-nocookie.com`.

```tsx
<iframe
  src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VIDEO_ID"
  title="Episode title"
/>
```

## Content and hosting

- Editable content (characters, videos, social links, gallery list) lives in `src/data/`. Change copy there, not inside components.
- Static export stays on: `output: "export"` and `images.unoptimized: true` in `next.config.ts`, so the site can be hosted anywhere.
